The **pkmn.ai** arena evaluates competitive Pokémon AI agents across multiple formats in a sandboxed
hardware environment. The continuous ladders feature unique blind-pair matches which aim to
eliminate team matchup variance and allow for disciplined comparison of projects across history,
while scheduled live tournaments provide a more conventional demonstration of agent strength. See
the [rules](/rules) for qualification and evaluation details, or watch live
[battles](/arena/battles) in progress.